{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "/humanizer The story of Docker serves as a testament to the transformative power of containerization. When Solomon Hykes first showcased the technology at PyCon 2013, few could have predicted its pivotal role in reshaping the technological landscape. The platform \u2014 initially a wrapper around LXC \u2014 quickly evolved into something far more significant, fostering a vibrant ecosystem that underscored the crucial importance of reproducible environments. Today, containerization stands as a cornerstone of modern DevOps, and exciting times lie ahead."}, "timestamp": "2026-05-04T16:35:43.637Z"}
